# Sites that 404 on bots but resolve fine in real browsers.
# LinkedIn returns 404 to non-logged-in crawlers as anti-scraping.
https://www\.linkedin\.com/.*

# Adobe's servers trip lychee's HTTP/2 handling ("HTTP/2 protocol error"),
# which is a transport complaint, not a dead link. Needed for the Adobe
# privacy policy we link from the Behance embed section on #/privacy.
https://www\.adobe\.com/.*
